# CHANGELOG

All notable changes to **sebastiano-riva** are documented in this file.

Format follows [Keep a Changelog](https://keepachangelog.com/en/1.0.0/).
Versioning follows career milestones, not semantic versioning — each release ships something real.

---

## [3.0.0] — 2025-04 · *Salty · Lima, Peru*
**Type:** Major release — First time as sole architect

### Added
- Co-founded consumer brand from zero to 50,000+ PEN in first-year revenue
- Full sales funnel ownership: inbound handling → qualification → conversion → retention
- Designed and executed digital customer acquisition strategy (paid + organic)
- Pricing strategy module and margin optimization engine

### Notes
> First release where I owned the entire roadmap. No senior dev to ask. Shipped anyway.

---

## [2.0.0] — 2025-05 · *Orange Capital Partners · Amsterdam, NL*
**Type:** Major release — Enterprise environment, live pipeline

### Added
- Inbound rental lead qualification using Authority, Need, and Timing framework
- CRM integration work across Salesforce, HubSpot, and Boomi
- Alternative revenue stream development across portfolio properties
- Improved lead response time and follow-up consistency → increased lease conversion rate

### Fixed
- Legacy follow-up gaps in CRM pipeline
- Data flow inconsistencies between platforms

---

## [1.1.0] — 2024-09 · *Erasmus University Rotterdam · MSc Financial Economics*
**Type:** Minor release — Compiler upgrade (in progress, ETA Aug 2026)

### Added
- Advanced modules: financial modelling, macroeconomics, investment analysis
- Venture Capital Analyst role at Asset Management Study Association
  - Analyzing Dutch startup funding rounds and emerging tech trends

---

## [1.0.1] — 2023 · *Rotterdam Student Rugby Club*
**Type:** Patch — High-pressure performance module

### Added
- Ereklasse selection (highest national rugby division)
- National Student Team selection
- Competitive resilience under elite conditions

### Notes
> Patch that permanently improved performance under pressure. Unexpected but essential.

---

## [1.0.0] — 2021-09 · *Erasmus University Rotterdam · BSc Economics & Business*
**Type:** Initial stable release

### Added
- Financial Economics major
- First structured exposure to market analysis, data interpretation, business fundamentals

---

## [0.1.0] — 2019-01 · *Galilea SAC · Lima, Peru*
**Type:** Alpha — First external deployment

### Added
- Cold outreach campaigns for market data collection
- Prospect qualification (early version, pre-ANT framework)
- Competitive analysis and Excel-based reporting

### Notes
> Rough around the edges. Core functionality was there. Good foundation to build on.

